    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_008_master_01",
      "hash64": "800BD84176DAD8E9",
      "text": "你愿意交给我的话，\\n我就帮你等级５０以上的宝可梦\\r\\n进行极限特训哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_008_master_02",
      "hash64": "800BD54176DAD3D0",
      "text": "你……\\n想让宝可梦进行极限特训吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_008_master_03",
      "hash64": "800BD64176DAD583",
      "text": "你想让哪只宝可梦\\n进行极限特训？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_008_master_cancel",
      "hash64": "A65424BE9F55C27C",
      "text": "……需要时再来找我吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_008_master_04",
      "hash64": "800BDB4176DADE02",
      "text": "嗯？你好像既没有金色王冠，\\n也没有银色王冠啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_008_master_05",
      "hash64": "800BDC4176DADFB5",
      "text": "要是宝可梦没有达到等级５０，\\n是无法承受极限特训的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_008_master_06",
      "hash64": "800BD94176DADA9C",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0102(0001)]\\n已经强大到不再需要特训了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0102",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_008_master_07",
      "hash64": "800BDA4176DADC4F",
      "text": "你要使用金色王冠，\\n还是银色王冠呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
