      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_008_master_08",
      "hash64": "800BDF4176DAE4CE",
      "text": "你想提高它所有的能力对吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_008_master_09",
      "hash64": "800BE04176DAE681",
      "text": "要提高哪项能力呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sub_008_master_10",
      "hash64": "800EDD4176DD173F",
      "text": "你做好心理准备了吗？\\n极限特训要开始了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sub_008_master_11",
      "hash64": "800EDC4176DD158C",
      "text": "那项能力\\n已经强大到不需要特训了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
